{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1000_p", "source_sha256": "59d100e7f3e80c8be39f45b3d7565cab6a479a01d8e981b9913619e00bc9a88b", "ja": "（服のPRも兼ねた、レトロ喫茶店のコラボ当日。\n春香考案のスイーツも完成し、間もなく開店だ）", "zh": "（兼顾服装宣传的复古咖啡店联动活动当天。\n春香设计的甜点也完成了，马上就要开店了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "1e6b38dd2d94e039724ebf15ec9a6ced9bf727be95a6907de942b1500d672738", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\n店内の準備、終わりまし……わあ～！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n店里的准备工作，做完……哇啊～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "e862db6aa68398cf6550ccd726f70569b3ffbeb3db673db066a9838c2e286be4", "ja": "え、えへへ。危ない危ない、セーフ……！\nせっかくのお洋服を汚しちゃうところでした……。", "zh": "诶、诶嘿嘿。好险好险，安全着陆……！\n差点就把这身难得的漂亮衣服弄脏了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e7a1799360414ab7cbbf3813915043f0e903ddf93f8519ff0e0c30833d7131f4", "ja": "だ、大丈夫か、春香？", "zh": "春香，没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "ead3d3406cb1cf1a49286e1c23ec6c1884063b2a2eaf6be46eaaf783ab0e3940", "ja": "はい。その、いよいよ開店の日なんだって思ったら\nなんだか落ち着かなくて……。", "zh": "是的。那个，一想到终于到了开店的日子，就总觉得静不下心来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "eff02e2fbc8c2a9dea091016e540515fcbb58c8a88547148f1f0bead60590963", "ja": "洋服のプロデュースに、今回のコラボメニューの\n試作に……今日まで突き進んできましたから！", "zh": "从服装的制作，到这次联动菜单的试做……我们一路拼到了今天！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b3598d37cd2ea9ed2389403c675400a4de54eaed6e3c477e4a680cd69f9c35db", "ja": "確かに、毎日大変だったよな。何度も作り直して……\nたまに、とんでもないのが生まれたりもして……。", "zh": "确实，每天都很辛苦呢。反反复复地重做……\n偶尔还会诞生出一些奇奇怪怪的东西……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "a357af42274512f3a49186bc9777e1a68066c08fbbb957343d2493d0fb13ce4c", "ja": "ううっ。あはは、そうですね……。\nまさか私も、あんな味になるとは思いませんでした。", "zh": "呜呜。啊哈哈，确实是这样……  \n没想到连我自己都没想到，居然会做出那种味道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "6fd96946a79fcf8a316e02a4c5a0b510d004ee2412e7d4d2d6c1cd47ff7f0f3a", "ja": "でも……そういうことも含めて、\nすごくワクワクして、楽しかったです！", "zh": "不过……包括那种情况在内，\n我真的觉得特别期待，也特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1009_p", "source_sha256": "db8784c699ab0353ad3fcdbe53a61b716cc5570db17146dc59c200de814f64d0", "ja": "はは、それはよかった。そういえば、最終的に決めた\nコラボメニューだけど、どうしてアレにしたんだ？", "zh": "哈哈，那就好。对了，说到最后决定的联名菜单，你为什么选了那个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "45c3c02e5dc06f40158d933d928ade1da0c826686743a23cb2d5f15494bdaf27", "ja": "どうしてって……。えっと……味も見た目も、\nみんなが喜んでくれそうだなっていうのと……。", "zh": "为什么嘛……那个……我觉得不管是味道还是卖相，大家应该都会喜欢……还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "09a675b5d81c0741486f51d858106911bf6c9b82dea32fe2c7a18ff011aaff31", "ja": "何より、食べた時の{$P$}さんの\n反応が一番よかったので。これにしよう、って。", "zh": "最重要的是，吃到{$P$}先生时的反应最好。所以，就选这个吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1012_p", "source_sha256": "58ae033bc7cb7446c95d1a53ed01bb87faca56d6f6914d481f54cfa892c53e53", "ja": "えっ？　俺の？", "zh": "诶？我的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "d3c8772c6ef1780f1f384b237fce8dec84f5ef093fb230e236375a2e66a62ae1", "ja": "はい！　とっても、いい表情でしたから……。\nあの笑顔を見て、すごく自信をもらえたんです。", "zh": "是的！因为您的表情真的特别好看……\n看到那个笑容，我获得了莫大的自信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c9841553fdd062e889199f72b63c2c31418ab7f1896a2c4a55908add626b42dc", "ja": "そうだったのか。すごく美味しいとは思ったけど、\n少しプレッシャーを感じるな……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。虽然我觉得特别好吃，但还是感觉有点压力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "a7bdd72431dd515f7506ef70c728ce24d769b89de7be003e528be9fe7a53bc92", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ。今までに一番、私が作ったお菓子を\n食べてるのは、{$P$}さんですから。", "zh": "没关系的。毕竟吃我做的点心吃得最多的，\n一直都是{$P$}先生嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "c81e713097580aa8f0eaa16d3ed3aa8b6b03825cd9860324cfaa8058797ddf50", "ja": "そんな{$P$}さんの「美味しい」が、\n一番参考になりますし、自信にもなるんです♪", "zh": "正是这样的{$P$}先生所说的“好吃”，最有参考价值，也能让我更有自信呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1cb58b8e713986e68e8bec8cfc8c680b76c0894e477cfe4bb981db133fcd24e0", "ja": "そうか。春香がそこまで言うなら、\n自分の舌を信じることにするよ。", "zh": "这样啊。既然春香都这么说了，我就相信自己的舌头吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "027399c0fd2abf13847d5da4fedcca40070da5aac825064967ff1a1f03d2e4c7", "ja": "はい♪　……って、つい話し込んじゃいましたね。\n私も開店の準備をしないと！", "zh": "好的♪……不知不觉聊了这么久呢。我也得准备开店了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0674_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0674_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "ec3de71e5ac43c013795b87dba5ab87dfea267708311f738f2b6730d478b0a85", "ja": "今日はホールでおもてなしの日ですから。\n慌てず、落ち着いて……ですね。えへへ♪", "zh": "今天是在大厅招待客人的日子。\n别慌，冷静下来……对吧。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
